<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Culver City USD, Calif., $10 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Fresno Unified S.D., Calif., $30 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Bienville Ind. Dt. No. 2, La., $2.5 million school GOs.</p>
<p>--Tewksbury, Mass., $3.1 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Kenilworth, N.J., $2.44 million general improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Fort Bend Lev. Dt. No. 7, Texas, $1.960 million Levee Imp. bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
